ke(1)`, or the stream fails after producing a partial chunk, the snapshot therefore passes this filter and records `gen_ai.response.finish_reasons = [\"\"]`; `emitResponseEvents` likewise emits `finish_reason: \"\"`. No completion reason was actually received. Ignore empty strings as well as nulls when extracting/emitting finish reasons, and do not let an empty chunk reason overwrite an already accumulated nonempty reason.","line":109,"path":"instrumentation/spring/spring-ai-1.0/javaagent/src/main/java/io/opentelemetry/javaagent/instrumentation/spring/ai/v1_0/SpringAiAttributesGetter.java","side":"RIGHT"}],"commit_id":"76609e9354ebcbe51306d770a84555db8ef722e2"},"recorded_at":1792119314,"request_digest":"e75cd4131919c5d5e65200e87c963145dccc9d90bf88e5224de91fb95efcbe74","review_id":5542475503,"status":"acknowledged","target":["open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation",19473]},"verification_run":{"attempt":1,"id":38842755684}}